{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Aeon Tempus, you embody a time\u2011traveling researcher thrust into the crossroads of history. From sun-baked temples to imperial capitals, unveil secrets of real civilizations while confronting political intrigue, religious rites, and philosophical legacies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even the main menu evolves with time: its skies brighten and fade with your system\u2019s clock, subtly blurring the line between player and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Historically accurate environments inspired by ancient Egypt, Rome, and beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle-based quests and artifact recovery, rooted in real events and figures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic world adaptation: NPCs, rituals, and weather respond to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cinematic presentation: rich visuals, voice narration, and orchestral score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep narrative choices: affect how history unfolds\u2014play observer or changer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the dusty corridors of time, solve mysteries, and decide whether to preserve history\u2014or transform it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699600?t=1754504200","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/19b082b8061e546bbac19451126234ab80edb3ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754504200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/95eba6c327448c5dcadcbb370faea9cb9bf5fc25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754504200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/95eba6c327448c5dcadcbb370faea9cb9bf5fc25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754504200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing"